# Pawan AI Chatbot requires NO environment variables to run.
# API keys are entered by the user in-app and stored only in their browser.
#
# The one exception: if you deploy the optional serverless proxy (needed to
# call Anthropic directly from the browser due to CORS), it forwards the
# user's own key from a request header — it does not need or store a key of
# its own. No variables are defined here yet; this file is a placeholder for
# that proxy's deployment docs in Milestone 4.
